{"about_the_game":"Through a blue shining light, you awaken in the center of a circle of menhirs. You don't remember anything, except that you must find &quot;Dyeus&quot;... <br><br>Go in a search for it in a primitive and cryptic open world. Fight against the Shadows and the Guardians, two factions in a war, along with a carnivorous fauna and redoubtable bosses, and explore a hostile world with a nebulous past... An adventure full of challenges awaits!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/a77f9049950f8e5b9edb238ef1fe04a0.poster.avif?t=1748019637\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/a77f9049950f8e5b9edb238ef1fe04a0.webm?t=1748019637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/a77f9049950f8e5b9edb238ef1fe04a0.mp4?t=1748019637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A true open world adventure</strong><br>Explore a fully open world with diverse biomes and discover devastated locations and hidden secrets. No barrier to stop you!<br>Features a day and night cycle, and a weather system.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/b22ea0bcd13fb0ed5f71f2182de63bc0.poster.avif?t=1748019637\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/b22ea0bcd13fb0ed5f71f2182de63bc0.webm?t=1748019637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/b22ea0bcd13fb0ed5f71f2182de63bc0.mp4?t=1748019637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Nervous and challenging fights</strong><br>Religious fanatics with primitive weapons, powerful warriors with plasma cannons, as well as a wild and carnivorous fauna.<br>Fight against more than 50 fast and deadly enemies, each requiring a different strategy... or let them kill each others in a deep infighting system!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/22939381e9373b74d3925b10e7054be1.poster.avif?t=1748019637\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/22939381e9373b74d3925b10e7054be1.webm?t=1748019637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/22939381e9373b74d3925b10e7054be1.mp4?t=1748019637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Continual player progression</strong><br>Find a wide range of different weapons, from a simple old bone to heavy plasma weaponry, along with various swords, spears and bows, and search for health upgrades or buy armors in shops to improve yourself.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/83dbc55b5bb714ffcf9daa641745054a.poster.avif?t=1748019637\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/83dbc55b5bb714ffcf9daa641745054a.webm?t=1748019637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/83dbc55b5bb714ffcf9daa641745054a.mp4?t=1748019637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A pure gameplay experience</strong><br>Like good old times, no cutscenes or long narrative sequence.<br>Play right from the start and find more than 40 hidden books to uncover the story of this world facing war and desolation.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/663bef5de29779cfcca9bfdcec2851c6.poster.avif?t=1748019637\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/663bef5de29779cfcca9bfdcec2851c6.webm?t=1748019637\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/extras/663bef5de29779cfcca9bfdcec2851c6.mp4?t=1748019637\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>A retro eletro-tribal soundtrack</strong><br>Listen to upbeat, primitive and wild tunes inspired by 90s computer games !","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1304400?t=1748019637","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748019637","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748019637","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1304400/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748019637","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Through a blue shining light, you awaken in the center of a circle of menhirs. You don't remember anything, except that you must find &quot;Dyeus&quot;... <br><br>Go in a search for it in a primitive and cryptic open world. Fight against the Shadows and the Guardians, two factions in a war, along with a carnivorous fauna and redoubtable bosses, and explore a hostile world with a nebulous past... An adventure full of challenges awa